# github's linguist ranks languages by BYTES, and a notebook is mostly base64
# plot images rather than code. this repo is 242 MB of notebooks against 0.8 MB
# of python, so it reported as 79% "Jupyter Notebook" while the thing it ships
# is a python package - 4.5k lines in src/omicstra, 13k in scripts, 1.2k in
# tests. the notebooks are exploration and the html is a generated report;
# neither is the source.
#
# this changes the language bar only. nothing is hidden, ignored, or excluded
# from the repository.

*.ipynb                 linguist-documentation

# generated report output. also collapses their diffs, which matters when a
# single file is 60 MB.
docs/**/*.html          linguist-generated
docs/reports/**         linguist-generated